    "updated_at": "2024-08-06T17:57:01Z",
    "body": "There are some other examples that may be relevant from the URL spec:\r\n\r\ne.g. `new URLPattern(\"hello:world\", \"https://example.com/\")` resolves to `{protocol:\"https\", \r\nhostname:\"example.com\", pathname:\"/hello:world\"}`\r\n\r\nbut it should have protocol `hello` and path `world`.\r\n\r\ne.g. `new URLPattern(\"urn:isbn:9780307476463\")` resolves to `{protocol:\"urn:isbn\", hostname:\"\", pathname:\"9780307476463\"}`\r\n\r\nbut it should have protocol `urn` and path `isbn:9780307476463`\r\n",
